          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2" defaultTabSize="72"><strong><span color="rgba(217, 138, 33, 1)" fontSize="19.0" fontFamily="Heiti SC" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">行为学评估</span></strong></p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="376.308031496063" height="129.6" topLeftX="67.68" topLeftY="191.51999999999998" type="text" id="bAV">
        <content verticalAlign="top" fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" textAlign="left">
          <ul listStyle="pptx-bullet">
            <li>
              <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="fixed:18.00" afterLineSpacing="fixed:6.00" marginLeft="14" indent="0" defaultTabSize="72" bulletSize="100%"><span color="rgba(22, 34, 46, 1)" fontSize="12.5" fontFamily="Heiti SC" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">GCS、CRS-R 等量表都要求患者把认知转成可观察的动作或言语。</span></p>
            </li>
            <li>
              <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="fixed:18.00" afterLineSpacing="fixed:6.00" marginLeft="14" indent="0" defaultTabSize="72" bulletSize="100%"><span color="rgba(22, 34, 46, 1)" fontSize="12.5" fontFamily="Heiti SC" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">在睡眠、麻醉、瘫痪、闭锁综合征、no-report 范式下失效。</span></p>
            </li>
            <li>
              <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="fixed:18.00" afterLineSpacing="fixed:6.00" marginLeft="14" indent="0" defaultTabSize="72" bulletSize="100%"><span color="rgba(22, 34, 46, 1)" fontSize="12.5" fontFamily="Heiti SC" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">结果可能被系统性低估：认知仍在，输出通道损坏。</span></p>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </content>
      </shape>
