        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="376.308031496063" height="129.6" topLeftX="515.988031496063" topLeftY="191.51999999999998" type="text" id="bAD">
        <content verticalAlign="top" fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" textAlign="left">
          <ul listStyle="pptx-bullet">
            <li>
              <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="fixed:18.00" afterLineSpacing="fixed:6.00" marginLeft="14" indent="0" defaultTabSize="72" bulletSize="100%"><span color="rgba(22, 34, 46, 1)" fontSize="12.5" fontFamily="Heiti SC" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">任务态 fMRI / EEG / fNIRS / 自主神经指标，不依赖运动输出。</span></p>
            </li>
            <li>
              <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="fixed:18.00" afterLineSpacing="fixed:6.00" marginLeft="14" indent="0" defaultTabSize="72" bulletSize="100%"><span color="rgba(22, 34, 46, 1)" fontSize="12.5" fontFamily="Heiti SC" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">已有研究能在无反应患者中检出与执行指令一致的脑活动。</span></p>
            </li>
            <li>
              <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="fixed:18.00" afterLineSpacing="fixed:6.00" marginLeft="14" indent="0" defaultTabSize="72" bulletSize="100%"><span color="rgba(22, 34, 46, 1)" fontSize="12.5" fontFamily="Heiti SC" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">代价：意识本身没有可直接观测的金标准，即 ground truth 缺失。</span></p>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </content>
